**D3_15: Advanced Authentication Testing (JWT, OAuth, SAML)**

- Phase 1-2: JWT token validation (expiry, signature, algorithm confusion)
- Phase 2-3: OAuth flow testing (redirect validation, scope bypass)
- Phase 3: SAML assertion testing (XML signature bypass)

**D3_16: Credential Capture & Reuse Detection**

- Phase 1: Check for leaked credentials in past breaches (HaveIBeenPwned, Dehashed)
- Phase 2: Test credential reuse across scope (if cred found, test all assets)
- Phase 3: Simulate lateral movement (if cred gives access to one asset, test others)

**D3_17: API Testing Framework (REST + GraphQL)**

- Detect API endpoints (from Burp/mitmproxy traffic)
- Fuzz parameters
- Test authentication + authorization
- Detect overly permissive CORS/ACAO headers

